<main><div class="wrap"><article class="article"><div class="eyebrow">CRANIO · Konfiguration</div><h1>Konfiguration — CRANIO</h1><p class="lead">Konfiguration beschreibt den Zustand eines Systems durch die Beziehungen zwischen seinen Teilen.</p><h2>Why configuration matters</h2><p>A system is not defined only by its individual parts. Configuration describes how those parts relate, align, distribute load and change together.</p><h2>From experience to configuration</h2><p>Experience gives the human entry point. Observation makes the state visible. Configuration gives the system a precise way to describe what is happening without prematurely assigning a cause.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn dark" href="../experience/">Explore experience</a><a class="btn" href="../method/">Method</a></div></article></div></main>